url: "https://github.com/RascalZ/REO"
abstract: "Research software comparing expression, within-sample ranks and relative-expression gene pairs with tissue references in cancer-cell-line drug-response prediction. Version 0.1.0 retains 64 frozen models, zero molecular solutions and minimal identity/fold metadata. The study did not establish an average REO predictive advantage. The software and research assets are archived on Zenodo. No paper DOI is claimed. Code uses MIT, while author-owned model and derived assets have a separate CC BY 4.0 grant; third-party data and identifiers are not relicensed."
keywords:
  - pharmacogenomics
  - relative expression ordering
  - drug response prediction
  - reproducible research
